cog-sharp

The C# generator and template files are derived from grafana/cog PR #1098
by fdrstrok, commit 6dcd12124553a7adbe8b9b1fc37176d55fb812ba:
https://github.com/grafana/cog/pull/1098

The naming and numeric helpers are adapted from grafana/cog.
