Modified for cog-sharp: standalone language-plugin integration, public Cog
APIs, RPC-safe hints and file metadata, C# properties and nullable types,
identifier escaping, typed variant serialization, executable regression
tests, and repository tooling. SDK builder hooks are adapted from the
Foundation SDK Java override templates at pinned commit
72b873117be02d3cd352c4ac8590b6555b0d1ce2, under the same Apache-2.0 license.

